; colsum_ungridded: COLSUM on a register with no grid must raise.
;
; The other half of COLSUM's missing fault coverage. No RESIZE ran, so
; there is no column to sum: raising matches ONEHOTC's no-grid behaviour
; rather than pushing 0 from an empty reduction.

PUSH 4
BQMX r0

PUSH 0           ; col
COLSUM r0
HALT
